# Secrets
.env

# Dataset - large / competition-provided, do not commit.
# Keep the folder itself (via .gitkeep) so the structure is visible.
# If the dataset's license allows it and you want the README tracked in git,
# add an explicit `!data/<its-readme-name>` exception yourself.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# Generated reports are reproducible from the dataset - keep folder, ignore contents.
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
